1
00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:02,060
I never learned what happened to Yeagher.

2
00:00:03,330 --> 00:00:04,840
We found him three days later.

3
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:07,660
Shot twice to the head.

4
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:09,660
But let's get back to you.

5
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:14,180
Your first assignment for the JBA
was to rob a train in New York?

6
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:19,420
A private train used by a bank to transfer
liquid assets without drawing attention.

7
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:21,900
Did you know what the money was for?

8
00:00:22,550 --> 00:00:24,750
No, but Emile didn't want any witnesses.

9
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:27,520
He ordered me
to kill anyone I came across.

10
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:29,960
Lambert told me the exact opposite.

11
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:31,280
Zero casualties.

12
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:33,720
Who supplied your equipment
for this robbery?

13
00:00:34,290 --> 00:00:35,990
Lambert was posing as an arms dealer.

14
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:40,120
He sold equipment to Dufraisne so I could
still have access to my usual gear.

15
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:42,540
That was a big risk.

16
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,200
Too big.
